OL,3,AAir traffic chaos and compensation:
OL,4,A'Shutdown cost us more than #1,000'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatie and Phil Allen should have been
OL,7,Fenjoying their first holiday in
OL,8,Ftwo-and-a-half years. Instead, they are
OL,9,Fat home ringing round for refunds that
OL,10,Fwon't be paid.
OL,12,FThe couple are among the many thousands
OL,13,Fof air passengers caught up in the
OL,14,Fchaos caused by the four-hour shutdown
OL,15,Fof the UK's air traffic control system
OL,16,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
