OL,3,AAir traffic chaos and compensation:
OL,4,A'Shutdown cost us more than #1,000'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt means their holiday to Slovenia has
OL,7,Fbeen cancelled and - although their
OL,8,Fflight was refunded by British Airways
OL,9,F- they estimate being left #1,300 out
OL,10,Fof pocket from unused accommodation and
OL,11,Fexcursions.
OL,13,FIt's not the first time - and won't be
OL,14,Fthe last - when passengers are left
OL,15,Fflying on a wing and a prayer after
OL,16,Fproblems at UK airports. So, here is
OL,17,Fhow their case relates to others, and
OL,18,Fwhy they have taken such a big hit.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
